**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.output
**/.vinxi
**/.vite
.git
*.log
# Env files and mounted credentials are runtime-only (compose's env_file /
# volumes). Every Dockerfile's build stage does `COPY . .`, and the
# seed-demo image keeps the whole workspace in its final layer — without
# these lines a local .env would be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/secrets
# Local tooling state, design docs and private keys never belong in an image.
# Root-anchored on purpose: apps/web/src/components/docs/ is real source.
.claude/
.superpowers/
.impeccable/
docs/
presentation/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
